+/*
+ *	Description:
+ *		1. Execute E-Fuse read byte operation according as map offset and
+ *		    save to E-Fuse table.
+ *		2. Refered from SD1 Richard.
+ *
+ *	Assumption:
+ *		1. Boot from E-Fuse and successfully auto-load.
+ *		2. PASSIVE_LEVEL (USB interface)
