+/*--------------------------Define Parameters-------------------------------*/
+/*
+ * BB-PHY register PMAC 0x100 PHY 0x800 - 0xEFF
+ * 1. PMAC duplicate register due to connection: RF_Mode, TRxRN, NumOf L-STF
+ * 2. 0x800/0x900/0xA00/0xC00/0xD00/0xE00
